        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>The Kwikset 660, Residential Single Cylinder Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nKwikset's Single Cylinder Deadbolt offers ANSI Grade 3 security. It has an adjustable latch to fit 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets; and it will fit door thicknesses up to 1-3/4 inches. Operated by a key on the exterior and by a thumbturn on the interior of the door. It has a  lifetime mechanical warranty from Kwikset for tough, effective protection at an affordable price.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis Smartkey Kwikset Lock offers convenience and security. It allows you to re-key the lock yourself without removing from the door; this mean you will be able to key all your SmartKey locks to one Kwikset key. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder Deadbolt:</b> Deadbolt is thrown and retracted by key on the outside and by a thumbturn on the inside.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/grade-3-double-cylinder-deadbolt-kwikset-665\"><b>Double Cylinder Kwikset 665 Deadbolt</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n \r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grade 3 Kwikset 660 Single Cylinder Deadbolt:\r\n<ul> \r\n<li>ANSI Grade 3 Security.</li>\r\n<li>Kwikset SmartKey lock cylinder.</li>\r\n<li>Universal keying system.</li>\r\n<li>1\" Deadbolt  Throw.</li>\r\n<li>All-metal mechanics.</li>\r\n<li>Solid steel strike.</li>\r\n<li>Free spinning cylinder guard security.</li>\r\n<li>Sold as complete set.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li><b>Manufacture Lifetime Mechanical & Finish Warranty.</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Kwikset Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Outside Lock Diameter: 2-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Outside Lock Projection: 1-1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Inside Lock Diameter: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Inside Lock Projection: 31/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Thumb Turn Length: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: adjustable 1-3⁄8\" to 1-3⁄4\" </li>\r\n<li>Backset: adjustable for both 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Standard 1\" x 2-1/4\" Square Corner Strike Plate</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
